{
  "info": {
    "name": "Hub File Operations API",
    "description": "Comprehensive Postman collection for Hub File Upload and Download operations. Includes JWT authentication, multipart/form-data uploads, file validation, error handling, and test scripts.\n\n## API Overview\nThis collection provides endpoints for secure file upload and download operations using MinIO storage.\n\n## Features\n- **File Upload**: POST /api/files/upload with multipart/form-data support\n- **File Download**: GET /api/files/download/{fileId} with proper headers\n- **Authentication**: JWT Bearer token required\n- **Validation**: File type (JPEG/PNG), size limits (5MB), automatic compression\n- **Error Handling**: Comprehensive error responses for common scenarios\n- **Security**: Secure storage with unique filenames and checksums\n\n## File Upload Specifications\n- **Supported Formats**: JPEG, PNG\n- **Max File Size**: 5MB per file\n- **Compression**: Automatic resizing to max 1920x1080 pixels\n- **Storage**: MinIO with unique filenames\n\n## Authentication\nInclude JWT token in Authorization header:\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer <jwt_token>\n```\n\n## Environment Variables\n- `base_url`: API base URL (default: http://localhost:8080)\n- `jwt_token`: JWT access token\n- `file_id`: File ID for download operations\n\n## Usage\n1. Obtain JWT token from authentication collection\n2. Set jwt_token environment variable\n3. Use upload endpoint to upload files\n4. Use download endpoint to retrieve files by ID",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "hub-backend"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Base URL for the API"
    },
    {
      "key": "jwt_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "JWT access token for authentication"
    },
    {
      "key": "file_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "File ID returned from upload operation"
    },
    {
      "key": "uploaded_file_url",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "URL of uploaded file"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Authentication",
      "description": "Authentication setup for file operations",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Set JWT Token",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"user@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Login to obtain JWT token for file operations. This endpoint is from the authentication collection."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Response contains access token\", function () {",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('accessToken');",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('jwt_token', jsonData.accessToken);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "File Upload",
      "description": "File upload operations with validation and compression",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Upload File - Success",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "type": "file",
                  "description": "File to upload (JPEG/PNG, max 5MB)"
                },
                {
                  "key": "folder",
                  "value": "documents",
                  "type": "text",
                  "description": "Folder/category for file organization"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/files/upload",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "files", "upload"]
            },
            "description": "Upload a file with automatic validation, compression, and secure storage. Requires JWT authentication."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('jwt_token')) {",
                  "    throw new Error('JWT token not available. Please login first.');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Response contains file information\", function () {",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('fileId');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('fileUrl');",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('checksum');",
                  "    ",
                  "    // Store file ID for download tests",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('file_id', jsonData.fileId);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('uploaded_file_url', jsonData.fileUrl);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"File URL is valid\", function () {",
                  "    const jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(jsonData.fileUrl).to.match(/^\\//);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
